{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49874","headline":"金错刀 二 · 冯延巳","name":"金错刀 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日融融，草芊芊，黄莺求友啼林前。\n柳条嫋嫋拖金线，花蘂茸茸簇锦毡。\n鸠逐妇，燕穿帘，狂蜂浪蝶相翩翩。\n春光堪赏还堪翫，恼杀东风悞少年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯延巳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49874.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49874","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}